  "correct": "1",
  "solution": "We substitute the values from each option and solve the equation using BODMAS rule:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/8a6f93b0f8305d496162d41f65450f13e20c650df2dbe481929271174df469e9.png] \n\nOption 1) ×, +, ÷, –, =\n\n30 × 3 + __**16 ÷ 4**__ - 24 = 70\n\n__**30 × 3**__ + 4 - 24 = 70\n\n__**90 + 4**__ - 24 = 70\n\n__**94 - 24**__ = 70\n\n70 = 70\n\nOption 2) +, ×, –, ÷, =\n\n30 + 3 × 16 - __**4 ÷ 24**__ = 70\n\n30 + __**3 × 16**__ - 0.1 = 70\n\n__**30 + 48**__ - 0.1 = 70\n\n__**78 - 0.1**__ = 70\n\n77.9 ≠ 70\n\nOption 3) ×, ÷, +, –, =\n\n30 × __**3 ÷ 16**__ + 4 - 24 = 70\n\n__**30 × 0.1**__ + 4 - 24 = 70\n\n__**3 + 4**__ - 24 = 70\n\n__**7 - 24**__ = 70\n\n-17 ≠ 70\n\nOption 4) ÷, ×, –, +, =\n\n__**30 ÷ 3**__ × 16 - 4 + 24 = 70\n\n__**10 × 16**__ - 4 + 24 = 70\n\n__**160**__ - 4 __**+ 24**__ = 70\n\n__**184 - 4**__ = 70\n\n184 ≠ 70\n\nHence **the correct answer is option 1)**",
